2. THE PICTURES  --  NOT covered by the MIT License above
================================================================================

Everything under hd/ and thumbs/ is a reproduction of a work of art held by a
museum or institution, obtained via Wikimedia Commons. These files are NOT
licensed by this repository and the MIT grant above does not apply to them.

Each reproduction keeps the terms it arrived with. Those terms are recorded per
image in the catalogue data and shown in the app beside the work, as the
photographer or institution, the licence, and the Commons file it came from.
They are a mix of public-domain reproductions and Creative Commons licences,
most commonly CC BY variants, which require attribution and may require
share-alike.

If you reuse a picture from here, take its terms from that credit line and
follow them at the source. Do not assume the MIT grant above covers it.

If you hold rights in one of these reproductions and a credit here is wrong or
missing, the fix belongs in the catalogue data -- note the work's id, visible in
the address bar, and it can be corrected at the source.
